<h2 id="aciubtdd-trigger" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. Trigger and intent</h2>

| User says | Agent does |
|-----------|------------|
| **`aciubtdd`** + refactor plan **`.md` path** | **`implreftdd`** on that path + continuous **aciubtdd** loop until done or blocked. |
| **`aciubtdd`** without path | Loop on in-thread plan; if unclear, ask **one** question: which plan path? |
| **`aciubtdd`** + plan in **`wip/`** with partial `[X]` | Resume from first `[ ]` (**`resumimpltdd`** semantics via **implreftdd**). |

**Examples:**

```text
aciubtdd cursor_gen/refactor_plans/new/REFACTOR_CLITICS_SCS_FLAT_SCOPES.md
aciubtdd cursor_gen/refactor_plans/wip/REFACTOR_REMOVE_E2B_CLITICS.md
```

Persistent until user revokes, narrows scope, or a [stop condition](#aciubtdd-stop) fires.

