<h2 id="aciubtdd-delegate-impl" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">3. Impl delegate — implreftdd (required)</h2>

**Read and execute** implementation procedure from:

**`.cursor/rules/tdd/implreftdd-resumimpl-refactor-plan-followthrough.mdc`** (**`implreftdd`**)

That covers: full **implref** delegate, TDD step 3 override, runtime heuristics, and per-phase **TDD mode** one-liner.

**aciubtdd** = classic **aciub** discipline **on top of** **implreftdd** (not plain **implref**).

