| **2 TDD** | `.cursor/rules/tdd/onlyreftdd-refactor-plan-author-only.mdc` | **this file** + `.cursor/rules/tdd/implreftdd-resumimpl-refactor-plan-followthrough.mdc` |

**Do not mix chains** on one refactor.

